  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、灯織\r\nお疲れ様",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "お疲れ様です\r\nスタッフさんから、私の分は終了と聞いたのですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201302/2002013020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nこっちにも連絡来たよ、後は自由らしいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\n遊んでていいと言われました",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201302/2002013020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、いいと思うぞ\r\nここ、スキンダイビング？　ができるらしくてさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "機材背負ってみたいな感じじゃなくて、\r\n素潜りするやつなんだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、はい\r\nそれもスタッフさんから伺いました",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201302/2002013020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なんでも、かなり綺麗だとかで……\r\nすごい熱弁していらっしゃって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201302/2002013020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\n海好きなんだな、きっと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "かもしれません",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201302/2002013020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、見てくるといいよ\r\n海の中",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201302/2002013020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、でも\r\n今日は仕事で来ていますし",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201302/2002013020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "まだみなさん仕事をしている中で、\r\n私だけ遊ぶというのは、ちょっと……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201302/2002013020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうして？\r\n灯織の仕事はきっちり終わってるんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "誰も文句言わないよ\r\nちゃんとやった上なんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからな、楽しいことしたって大丈夫だ\r\nスタッフさんも見ておいでって言ってくれたんだろ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサーがそう言ってくれるなら",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201302/2002013020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、いっておいで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002013020170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──はい……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
